# CR 702.66a: Delve exiles cards from the caster's graveyard while the spell
# is cast. Each exiled card leaves the graveyard (GameAction.java:601-613), so
# Murktide Regent's "Whenever an instant or sorcery card leaves your
# graveyard" triggers twice. The triggers wait for the cast to finish and go
# on the stack above Treasure Cruise (TriggerHandler.java:264).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 7 U
tapformana human 8 U
tapformana human 9 U
tapformana human 10 U
tapformana human 11 U
tapformana human 12 U
queue cardchoice 2,3
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 1
resolvestack
